WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.391 --> 00:00:14.606
Open Schedule and choose Add appointment.

2
00:00:14.606 --> 00:00:22.521
The booking form opens over the real schedule.

3
00:00:22.521 --> 00:00:31.104
Choose the correct client and session type.

4
00:00:31.104 --> 00:00:38.145
Check the date and time carefully.

5
00:00:38.145 --> 00:00:45.183
Use one off for a single appointment.

6
00:00:45.183 --> 00:00:56.925
Use weekly only for a repeating series.

7
00:00:56.925 --> 00:01:05.652
Read every clash or skipped date.

8
00:01:05.652 --> 00:01:13.817
Cancel this demo without creating anything.

